# Panchnama environment variables
#
# No environment variables are required yet — Session 0 (repository bootstrap)
# does not introduce a database, server runtime, or secrets. This file is a
# placeholder so the convention exists before Session 9 (database foundation)
# and Session 10 (experience API) add real variables such as DATABASE_URL and
# abuse-key HMAC secrets.
#
# Copy to .env.local for local development once variables exist:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
